{"items":[{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#ec2d372d-7a21-4534-a634-302bd1ba379b","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"ec2d372d-7a21-4534-a634-302bd1ba379b","dateCreated":"2026-09-29T20:01:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2026-09-29T21:41:06+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"<p>AWS DataSync now supports shared Virtual Private Clouds (VPCs). You can create DataSync agents and run transfer tasks using subnets shared across AWS accounts with AWS Resource Access Manager (RAM).</p>\n<p>To learn more, visit the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/datasync/latest/userguide/choose-service-endpoint.html#datasync-in-vpc\" target=\"_blank\">AWS DataSync feature documentation</a>.</p>\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2026/09/aws-datasync-shared-vpcs/","postDateTime":"2026-09-29T08:00:00Z","headline":"AWS DataSync now supports shared VPCs"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2026","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2026","description":"description placeholder"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-datasync","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-datasync","description":"general:products/aws-datasync"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-vpc","description":"general:products/amazon-vpc"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#ae8c1ea0-8a30-4a3c-a31e-cb7acf985087","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"ae8c1ea0-8a30-4a3c-a31e-cb7acf985087","dateCreated":"2026-08-06T03:00:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2026-08-08T04:34:43+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"<p>Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) IP Address Manager (IPAM) now supports BGP route protection monitoring and delegated Resource Public Key Infrastructure (RPKI) management for Bring Your Own IP (BYOIP) prefixes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2026/08/amazon-vpc-ipam-bgp-rpki-byoip